!@Router
interface GigabitEthernet0/0/0.40
 encapsulation dot1Q 40
 ip address 192.168.6.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown


@Router
enable
configure terminal

!
! =========================================
! VLAN 40 MANAGEMENT - ROUTER
! =========================================
!

interface GigabitEthernet0/0/0
 no ip address
 no shutdown
exit

interface GigabitEthernet0/0/0.40
 description VLAN40-Management
 encapsulation dot1Q 40
 ip address 192.168.4.1 255.255.255.0
 ip nat inside
 no shutdown
exit

! =========================================
! LOCAL ADMIN USER
! =========================================
!

username admin privilege 15 secret 123
ip http authentication local

! =========================================
! SSH
! =========================================
!

crypto key generate rsa modulus 2048

ip ssh version 2

line vty 0 4
 login local
 transport input ssh
 exit

!
! =========================================
! HTTPS WEB GUI
! =========================================
!

no ip http server
ip http secure-server
ip http authentication local

!
! =========================================
! SAVE
! =========================================
!

end
write memory

!HTTP secure server trustpoint certificate
enable
configure terminal

crypto pki trustpoint HTTPS-SELF-SIGNED
 enrollment selfsigned
 subject-name CN=ISR-C4321
 rsakeypair HTTPS-SELF-SIGNED-KEY 2048
 hash sha256
exit

crypto pki enroll HTTPS-SELF-SIGNED

Pag nag-prompt:
% Include the router serial number in the subject name? [yes/no]:

sagot:
no

Then:
% Include an IP address in the subject name? [no]:

sagot:
no

Then:
Generate Self Signed Router Certificate? [yes/no]:

sagot:
yes

Cisco's documented procedure uses enrollment selfsigned, an RSA key pair, and crypto pki enroll to
generate the persistent self-signed certificate. Cisco
Pag successful
Dapat makakuha ka ng message na parang:
Router Self Signed Certificate successfully created

Then sabihin natin sa HTTPS server na gamitin ang certificate:
ip http secure-trustpoint HTTPS-SELF-SIGNED

Then:
end
write memory

Verify
Run:
show crypto pki certificates HTTPS-SELF-SIGNED

at:
show ip http server status

-------------------------------------------

